  m_Name: Kat1_Col_yazit_1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Boruhan.Dialogue.DialogueAsset
  lines:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    text: "Ta\u015Fa kaz\u0131nm\u0131\u015F eski bir yaz\u0131:"
    duration: 0
    setFlag: 
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    text: "\"Yeralt\u0131 dokuz katt\u0131r. Her kat, yery\xFCz\xFCnde i\u015Flenen bir g\xFCnah\u0131n a\u011F\u0131rl\u0131\u011F\u0131yla kaz\u0131lm\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r. \u0130lki yalan\u0131nkidir.\""
    duration: 0
    setFlag: 
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    text: "Alt\u0131na sonradan biri eklemi\u015F: \"Baz\u0131 duvarlar yalan s\xF6yler. \u0130nanma, y\xFCr\xFC.\""
    duration: 0
    setFlag: 
